  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A straight wire carrying a current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math>&nbsp;is bent into a semicircular arc of radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> as shown in the figure. The magnetic field produced by the current at the centre <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math> of the arc is ____ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#215;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8211;</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/7b9cea35-7c92-4ba4-ad93-e1a164009b0d.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 136px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/177a277e-d192-4dda-bed8-8ec48363908b.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 89px;\" /></p><p>It is given that&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p><p>The magnetic field at the centre&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi></math>&nbsp;is</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#956;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>i</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
